	TAD FRTIME
	CIA
	DCA TIMER
	JMS CLOCK
	JMS I IWINDO
	JMS DELAY
	ISZ TIMER
	JMP .-4
	JMP FRAME	/PREPARE NEW FRM
/DISPLAY OVER WHEN CONTROL PASSES HERE
/FROM FRAME-SEQUENCING ALGORITHM
/DISPLAY ALL POSTMASKS "AFTER" REFRESHES
EXIT,	CLA IAC
	TAD N
	CMA
	DCA MNPOST
	STA CLL RAL
	DCA MNSHOW
	STA CLL RAL
	DCA MNPRE
	TAD AFTER
