/SUBR DISPLAYS ONE FRAME OF MOVING
/WINDOW DISPLAY. THERE ARE N DISPLAY
/POSITIONS, WITH DX BETWEEN POSNS AND
/THE LINE CENTERED AT X0
	PAGE
WINDOW,	0
	LINC
	LMODE
	SET I 1
